{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:30ad879f1ed6fe9b","name":"Nu Toreena","source":{"id":"source:reference-30ad879f1ed6fe9b","title":"Nu Toreena","revision":20264,"timestamp":"2024-08-25T23:31:34Z","sha256":"24b2cb5b2255ff24debed05afbce6b5a7e35c2fc950909f474f1bfac0fda13e5","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=20264","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Nu%20Toreena&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-30ad879f1ed6fe9b","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Legacy Era Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Legacy_Era_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Affiliations: ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Galactic Alliance"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Galactic_Alliance","referenceId":"reference:bd53073ee6d4d9a0"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Nu Toreena is a member of the Triumvirate before the Battle of ",{"tag":"a","children":["Caamas"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Caamas","referenceId":"reference:325a6657b633ffd9"},", and arguably the weakest politically. She seeks to bring the war with ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Galactic Empire"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Galactic_Empire","referenceId":"reference:f9c9a48674cc3415"}," to a quick end, no matter what the risk. As an ",{"tag":"a","children":["Ithorian"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Ithorian","referenceId":"reference:d492327431f11ead"},", she knows the horror of losing a homeworld in a vicious war, as her people lost ",{"tag":"a","children":["Ithor"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Ithor","referenceId":"reference:4bdac3e58d564162"}," during the Yuuzhan Vong Invasion. She has no wish to see that happen to ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Galactic Alliance"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Galactic_Alliance","referenceId":"reference:bd53073ee6d4d9a0"},".\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["When Rear Admiral ",{"tag":"a","children":["Piers Petan"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Piers_Petan?action=edit&redlink=1"}," proposes a plan to ambush Emperor Fel's flagship over ",{"tag":"a","children":["Caamas"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Caamas","referenceId":"reference:325a6657b633ffd9"},", Toreena fully backs the effort, despite the fact that it would mean stripping ",{"tag":"a","children":["Coruscant"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Coruscant","referenceId":"reference:2ee37a21e9e7a955"}," of its protective fleet. After the Imperials spring their trap at the Battle of ",{"tag":"a","children":["Caamas"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Caamas","referenceId":"reference:325a6657b633ffd9"},", Toreena and the other members of the Triumvirate are forced to surrender ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Galactic Alliance"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Galactic_Alliance","referenceId":"reference:bd53073ee6d4d9a0"}," to the Empire. ",{"tag":"a","children":["Emperor Roan Fel"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Emperor_Roan_Fel"}," replaces the entire Triumvirate, Toreena is widely blamed for supporting the risky battle plan, and her political career comes to an abrupt end.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["Nu Toreena Statistics (CL 4)"]},"\n",{"tag":"h4","children":["Normal"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["Medium ",{"tag":"a","children":["Ithorian"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Ithorian","referenceId":"reference:d492327431f11ead"}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Nonheroic"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Nonheroic","referenceId":"reference:1bca2ef1d9ebe1c3"}," 12\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Initiative"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Initiative","referenceId":"reference:3e687de48a6ad4e5"},":"]}," +5; ",{"tag":"b","children":["Senses:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Perception"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Perception","referenceId":"reference:bd18e320a6bb9f5